WEBVTT

00:07.923 --> 00:13.683
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.183 --> 00:19.773
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.813 --> 00:28.363
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.363 --> 00:30.233
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.613 --> 00:34.163
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.493 --> 00:37.993
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.493 --> 00:40.833
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.833 --> 00:45.583
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.713 --> 00:48.923
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.883 --> 00:51.883
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.433 --> 01:01.143
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.473 --> 01:03.483
...with you.
futaride

01:04.483 --> 01:10.193
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.863 --> 01:16.283
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.493 --> 01:24.793
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.793 --> 01:26.623
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:31.253 --> 01:36.823
Remember, even for children's books,
you must not draw poorly.

01:37.453 --> 01:39.913
It is important to understand the basics,

01:39.953 --> 01:43.493
and add your own personality on top of it.

01:44.333 --> 01:45.793
Therefore,

01:46.393 --> 01:50.633
today's assignment is to sketch people.

01:50.673 --> 01:53.803
The deadline is tomorrow.

01:56.133 --> 01:59.263
So that is all for today.

01:59.303 --> 02:01.473
See you tomorrow.

02:01.513 --> 02:03.433
Sketches of people, huh?

02:04.933 --> 02:08.813
Please do not forget, OK?

02:11.193 --> 02:12.823
Right.

02:12.863 --> 02:14.113
Shiratori!

02:15.193 --> 02:17.113
Let's work on the assignment together!

02:18.283 --> 02:19.613
Sure.

02:19.953 --> 02:24.203
Then let's go to your place!

02:24.243 --> 02:24.953
Why?

02:24.993 --> 02:25.743
Oh, come on.

02:26.333 --> 02:27.963
Is it okay with you, Shiratori-kun?

02:28.003 --> 02:30.083
I guess.

02:30.123 --> 02:32.333
Yeah! It's decided!

02:32.383 --> 02:33.343
Let's go!

02:35.073 --> 02:39.783
Sketch

02:40.703 --> 02:43.323
There's an apartment building amongst
all these office buildings?

02:43.873 --> 02:46.163
That's what I thought, too.

02:46.163 --> 02:49.083
I think it was around here.

02:49.753 --> 02:51.403
I want to see her...

02:51.443 --> 02:52.983
To see her again!

02:53.613 --> 02:56.403
Where are you, Reiko-san?!

02:59.153 --> 03:01.033
Who is Reiko-san?

03:01.073 --> 03:02.033
I don't know.

03:02.073 --> 03:04.913
Did he find love at first sight again?

03:04.953 --> 03:06.793
Don't worry about him.

03:09.833 --> 03:10.373
Narutakisou

03:10.373 --> 03:11.833
Here we are.
Narutakisou

03:12.213 --> 03:13.923
Here?

03:15.043 --> 03:17.553
It's pretty awesome.

03:17.553 --> 03:18.963
Yeah...

03:24.053 --> 03:27.143
Kozue-chan, do you want to stop here for a minute?

03:31.233 --> 03:32.773
Not today.

03:32.813 --> 03:34.313
I want to do some shopping.

03:34.903 --> 03:37.613
Then I'll come with you.

03:37.863 --> 03:39.493
Thank you, Tamami-chan.

03:39.533 --> 03:40.693
No problem.

03:43.663 --> 03:47.283
Finally, alone with Kozue-chan!

03:50.203 --> 03:51.543
We have guests?

03:51.873 --> 03:53.173
Yeah, from school...

03:53.923 --> 03:55.923
Pretty Onee-san!

03:55.963 --> 03:58.553
Please, please, can I have your name?

04:00.093 --> 04:01.633
What's up with him?

04:02.133 --> 04:03.683
Um...

04:04.223 --> 04:06.553
Onee-san!

04:06.603 --> 04:07.053
Stop It!

04:10.893 --> 04:12.523
Doing homework together?

04:12.563 --> 04:13.363
Working hard?

04:13.363 --> 04:15.623
Yes, we are!

04:15.693 --> 04:19.553
Please be a model for us, Onee-san!

04:21.653 --> 04:24.433
Oh, should I?

04:30.183 --> 04:32.663
Shiratori-kun, we've got a problem!

04:32.663 --> 04:35.463
Somebody's down!

04:35.503 --> 04:37.293
Oh, it's Sayoko-san.

04:38.273 --> 04:39.383
Don't worry.

04:39.423 --> 04:40.843
She's just sleeping.

04:40.883 --> 04:42.463
Should you be so calm about it?

04:42.513 --> 04:44.843
Don't we have to bring blankets or something?

04:51.473 --> 04:54.563
Another pretty Onee-san!!

04:54.603 --> 04:56.693
Please, please, can I have your name?

04:56.733 --> 04:59.113
And be my friend.

04:59.443 --> 05:02.193
So he doesn't care who it is...

05:05.573 --> 05:06.743
Stop it!

05:08.913 --> 05:10.283
Excuse him.

05:16.983 --> 05:19.083
Cheese!

05:23.633 --> 05:24.473
Now then.

05:25.013 --> 05:27.303
Let's get this assignment over with.

05:27.343 --> 05:28.593
Yeah!

05:29.303 --> 05:30.763
Good luck!

05:30.803 --> 05:33.703
Why are you here too?

05:33.703 --> 05:37.143
Oh, don't mind us.

05:37.693 --> 05:40.023
Don't mind you? But still...

05:40.063 --> 05:42.113
He doesn't have any perverted books.

05:42.903 --> 05:44.363
How boring.

05:44.403 --> 05:45.693
You girls too!

05:46.403 --> 05:50.783
Oh, I just thought I'd check it out.

05:50.823 --> 05:53.163
I like that attitude!

05:53.203 --> 05:55.123
Let's get serious.

05:56.083 --> 05:57.253
Onii-chan?

05:58.503 --> 05:59.673
Asami-chan.

05:59.713 --> 06:01.293
Onii-chan, you have m...

06:03.173 --> 06:05.303
Here you are, Mom.

06:05.343 --> 06:07.383
We still have more work.

06:09.683 --> 06:12.473
Oh? Who are you?

06:12.993 --> 06:14.273
Hello.

06:14.273 --> 06:18.023
We are Shiratori-kun's friends from school.

06:18.063 --> 06:19.273
Nice to meet you.

06:20.523 --> 06:23.483
Oh? Aren't you going to do the same
thing to her as you did to us?

06:24.573 --> 06:26.863
I'm not interested in flat girls.

06:27.573 --> 06:30.243
You're such a low form of scum, I'm impressed.

06:30.573 --> 06:30.993
YES!

06:32.413 --> 06:33.243
Don't brag!

06:33.803 --> 06:34.993
What's flat??

06:35.043 --> 06:36.583
Don't worry about it.

06:43.753 --> 06:47.053
Shiratorii-san should be happy with this.

06:48.303 --> 06:50.553
Shiratori-san again?

06:51.183 --> 06:55.763
Over half of everything you talk about involves Shiratori-san.

06:55.813 --> 07:00.043
I don't think so...

07:00.503 --> 07:02.813
But it's true.

07:04.613 --> 07:07.213
Mom, I'll go home.

07:07.213 --> 07:08.903
Asami-chan, isn't that...

07:10.033 --> 07:12.783
Onii-chan, you have mail.

07:12.823 --> 07:14.243
Oh, thank you.

07:14.663 --> 07:17.293
Asami-chan, was there one for me too?

07:17.333 --> 07:18.413
There was.

07:20.333 --> 07:22.213
Here, the air mail like usual.

07:22.923 --> 07:23.633
Let me see!

07:34.683 --> 07:36.603
Who's that letter from?

07:36.643 --> 07:38.603
I don't know.

07:38.643 --> 07:41.773
But she always looks forward to those letters.

07:48.463 --> 07:50.943
Maybe she's in a long distance relationship!?

07:50.993 --> 07:51.903
I don't know.

07:52.493 --> 07:54.573
She's different from the usual Momono-san.

07:54.993 --> 07:57.413
I'll go back to work.

08:01.483 --> 08:03.673
We need to finish our homework!

08:03.673 --> 08:04.633
You're right.

08:04.673 --> 08:06.133
So, for our model...

08:06.173 --> 08:07.213
Yeah!

08:07.563 --> 08:09.823
First Annual Narutakisou Sketch Contest!

08:09.823 --> 08:10.803
Commencing...
First Annual Narutakisou Sketch Contest!

08:10.803 --> 08:11.193
Commencing...

08:12.593 --> 08:15.683
The winner will be awarded a great prize!

08:15.723 --> 08:19.393
I'm in a great mood right now, so it'll be pretty big!

08:19.433 --> 08:20.813
Yay!

08:20.853 --> 08:22.563
Here we go again.

08:22.603 --> 08:24.353
You need models, right?

08:24.403 --> 08:26.483
We'll step up for the role!

08:26.523 --> 08:28.443
Good luck, hopeful boys and girls!

08:33.073 --> 08:35.203
What are you doing?!

08:35.243 --> 08:37.373
Just a service.

08:37.413 --> 08:39.373
But not any more.

08:40.123 --> 08:41.043
No! No!

08:41.083 --> 08:42.083
It's okay!

08:42.123 --> 08:44.873
That's perfectly okay!

08:44.923 --> 08:47.233
This is art!

08:47.293 --> 08:49.383
There's nothing to be ashamed of!

08:49.423 --> 08:52.943
Go ahead, take them off!

09:00.473 --> 09:04.663
Um, so, we can keep our clothes on?

09:07.353 --> 09:10.233
Yes, just strike a normal pose.

09:10.273 --> 09:13.243
Then how about this?

09:13.713 --> 09:17.843
It's not for sexy shots, so take your usual pose.

09:17.843 --> 09:18.323
It's OK!
It's not for sexy shots, so take your usual pose.

09:18.323 --> 09:18.973
It's OK!

09:18.973 --> 09:20.583
Super OK!

09:22.793 --> 09:26.213
I thought they were nice poses.

09:26.253 --> 09:27.673
Please be normal.

09:27.713 --> 09:28.833
Really normal.

09:28.883 --> 09:31.383
Normal, huh?

09:31.423 --> 09:32.713
What should we do, Sayo-chan?

09:40.973 --> 09:43.703
Hurry, draw.

09:43.703 --> 09:45.603
That's a pose?!

09:45.643 --> 09:48.483
Not like that, Sayo-chan.

09:50.813 --> 09:53.693
I knew it, but they really are unique.

09:55.113 --> 09:58.033
So, what are we going to do?

09:58.073 --> 10:00.953
I don't care, so just strike a pose.

10:05.203 --> 10:05.833
So?

10:07.123 --> 10:08.423
Are you close to being done?

10:08.463 --> 10:10.753
Yes, I'm about done.

10:10.793 --> 10:12.463
I'm okay too!

10:12.503 --> 10:13.483
Me too.

10:13.483 --> 10:13.923
Yeah.

10:13.963 --> 10:17.903
OK! Then it's grading time!

10:17.903 --> 10:21.243
Entry Number 1

10:24.013 --> 10:26.523
Good job, art school student!

10:26.563 --> 10:28.233
It's really good.

10:29.943 --> 10:31.903
But there's no impact.

10:35.343 --> 10:38.673
Entry Number 2

10:41.703 --> 10:44.223
Um, how should I put it?

10:44.223 --> 10:45.723
It's avant garde drawing.

10:45.723 --> 10:47.963
You must be talented.

10:47.963 --> 10:49.213
Really?

10:49.253 --> 10:51.213
Am I talented?

10:51.213 --> 10:54.553
If the public can recognize it.

10:56.983 --> 10:59.903
Entry Number 3

11:02.973 --> 11:03.973
Good!

11:04.013 --> 11:05.223
But...

11:05.223 --> 11:09.103
What was the point of using us as models?

11:11.543 --> 11:14.173
Entry Number 4

11:17.613 --> 11:20.113
Are you okay with that...

11:20.613 --> 11:22.113
as a man?

11:24.763 --> 11:28.643
For now, Shiratori-kun is in the lead!

11:28.643 --> 11:31.873
The 2nd round will be held in the
courtyard with new models!

11:33.213 --> 11:34.753
We're going to do more?

11:35.813 --> 11:38.233
Go out into the courtyard.

11:39.613 --> 11:42.613
Let's play in your room.

11:42.613 --> 11:46.743
But it looks like we have guests.

11:46.743 --> 11:48.433
Two more captured!

11:49.243 --> 11:51.273
You two, give us a few minutes.

11:51.543 --> 11:52.943
Oh, okay...

11:53.753 --> 11:58.093
Damn, spoiling our fun.

12:10.272 --> 12:12.002
Models must be pretty!

12:12.042 --> 12:12.932
And sauries must be broiled!

12:12.932 --> 12:14.522
Here they are!
And sauries must be broiled!

12:16.852 --> 12:18.022
Kozue-chan!

12:19.652 --> 12:21.902
We're bringing out the good stuff.

12:21.902 --> 12:23.802
Thank you for the other day!

12:23.842 --> 12:27.302
I'm very grateful that you'll be modeling for us!

12:28.262 --> 12:30.312
Hey, wait...

12:30.352 --> 12:32.942
Again...

12:32.982 --> 12:35.982
Yet again...

12:36.022 --> 12:38.232
That voice... could she be...

12:38.272 --> 12:42.632
Ignoring me again?!

12:42.632 --> 12:44.262
Why is she here?!

12:44.262 --> 12:46.782
Tamami-chan lives here too.

12:46.822 --> 12:49.622
Tell that to me earlier!

12:49.662 --> 12:51.582
Excuse me.

12:51.622 --> 12:54.752
Please draw me pretty.

12:54.792 --> 12:56.002
Yes, of course!

12:56.042 --> 12:58.252
Why me?!

12:58.632 --> 13:01.512
So, Tama-chan will team up with him.

13:01.552 --> 13:03.132
Thank you.

13:03.802 --> 13:06.052
It's been decided?

13:06.092 --> 13:08.262
And the glasses girl with Asami-chan.

13:08.302 --> 13:09.492
Hello.

13:09.492 --> 13:10.642
Yes...

13:12.892 --> 13:14.852
Um, what about me?

13:14.892 --> 13:16.022
Look behind you.

13:22.572 --> 13:24.402
Thank you.

13:24.452 --> 13:25.282
Yeah!

13:25.902 --> 13:27.612
Draw me handsomely.

13:28.162 --> 13:30.532
Um...

13:31.832 --> 13:34.082
He's my extra.

13:34.122 --> 13:36.622
You just need to draw me!

13:37.252 --> 13:39.152
Yes...

13:39.152 --> 13:42.152
Looking good.

13:42.152 --> 13:44.922
Then Kozue-chan and Shiratori-kun!

13:49.472 --> 13:51.262
Thanks.

13:51.722 --> 13:53.562
Yes...

13:54.182 --> 13:56.142
Start!

13:56.732 --> 13:59.692
We'll just wait, since we're already tired.

14:21.292 --> 14:24.212
I didn't expect this.

14:24.252 --> 14:25.802
I am a bit happy about it, though.

14:26.942 --> 14:28.342
Um...

14:28.382 --> 14:29.512
What is it?

14:29.552 --> 14:33.262
Would you show it to me when you're finished drawing?

14:33.262 --> 14:34.522
Of course!

14:34.562 --> 14:35.812
Great.

14:35.852 --> 14:36.772
I can't wait.

14:38.732 --> 14:43.822
Oh, what should a model do?

14:43.862 --> 14:47.112
Well, let's see...

14:48.282 --> 14:51.242
Why don't you stand in front of those trees?

14:51.282 --> 14:51.952
Yes.

14:59.212 --> 15:00.372
Um...

15:02.462 --> 15:04.422
is this okay?

15:05.092 --> 15:06.342
Yeah.

15:13.512 --> 15:15.222
Is something the matter?

15:15.262 --> 15:16.562
Uh, no.

16:11.112 --> 16:15.452
Um, have we met before?

16:15.492 --> 16:16.742
You don't remember?

16:18.332 --> 16:19.752
I guess not.

16:19.792 --> 16:22.752
It's been over ten years, after all.

16:47.312 --> 16:48.522
I see.

16:49.152 --> 16:50.482
That's it!

16:52.532 --> 16:53.952
Is something the matter?

16:53.992 --> 16:55.242
Uh, no.

17:05.792 --> 17:07.882
I don't approve of this!

17:07.922 --> 17:09.502
Do it again!

17:10.632 --> 17:12.922
But, uh...

17:13.262 --> 17:15.052
I told you to draw me!

17:15.092 --> 17:16.822
Why didn't you?!

17:16.822 --> 17:20.182
Because I'm supposed to draw a person.

17:20.222 --> 17:22.602
Why is this happening to me?!

17:24.022 --> 17:24.942
I'm done.

17:25.312 --> 17:27.062
That's great!

17:35.742 --> 17:38.372
I see...

17:41.742 --> 17:46.622
I see that I need to sit down and have a talk with you.

17:47.622 --> 17:48.212
About what?

17:48.252 --> 17:52.092
In whatever subject, what's most important are the basics.

17:52.132 --> 17:54.212
You don't understand that.

17:54.902 --> 17:58.592
Don't talk like our teacher!

18:01.432 --> 18:03.682
OK, this should do.

18:04.812 --> 18:06.812
May I see?

18:06.852 --> 18:08.102
Y-yeah.

18:17.862 --> 18:18.992
It's nice.

18:20.242 --> 18:22.332
It's a little embarrassing,

18:22.372 --> 18:24.792
but looking at it makes me feel relaxed.

18:26.372 --> 18:31.042
It makes me feel warm inside.

18:33.132 --> 18:38.552
Your drawings have always been filled with such warmth.

18:39.112 --> 18:42.302
Shiratori-san, work hard, and someday...

18:43.142 --> 18:45.522
Someday, become a children's book author.

18:46.042 --> 18:52.062
Just like me, I'm sure that there will be many
people who will be saved by your drawings.

18:58.172 --> 19:02.202
I will be supporting you as your fan.

19:08.352 --> 19:12.852
Let's start the final scoring to decide
the winner of the grand prize!

19:12.852 --> 19:14.632
What's the grand prize?

19:14.982 --> 19:16.422
It is...

19:18.112 --> 19:21.052
a se-cr-et.

19:21.512 --> 19:22.282
You mean,

19:22.282 --> 19:27.062
our beautiful hostess would do this, that, and other things to us?

19:27.562 --> 19:29.232
Who knows?

19:31.332 --> 19:32.982
I'm heating up now!

19:34.752 --> 19:37.072
There he goes again.

19:37.112 --> 19:39.532
It's too late to be getting warm now.

19:39.572 --> 19:42.452
Well, let us see your drawings.

19:44.742 --> 19:46.012
Shiratori-san.

19:46.012 --> 19:48.332
Yup, would you put it down?

19:48.372 --> 19:50.792
I brought some juice.

19:52.732 --> 19:53.792
Asami...

20:04.262 --> 20:07.142
How could you do this?!

20:07.182 --> 20:09.272
Our homework...

20:14.332 --> 20:15.862
Oh my...

20:18.982 --> 20:20.532
Thank God...

20:25.202 --> 20:28.052
It is very well done.

20:28.662 --> 20:30.472
Is it?

20:31.142 --> 20:35.062
I can sense a great affection for your model.

20:35.062 --> 20:37.462
Please keep going like this from now on.

20:37.502 --> 20:38.752
Yes.

20:38.802 --> 20:39.922
Now, for you three...

20:41.722 --> 20:45.682
Please come with me.

20:45.722 --> 20:47.052
Why?

20:47.102 --> 20:49.312
We submitted our homework too.

20:49.352 --> 20:51.202
Shiratori-kun, would you please say something?

20:53.412 --> 20:58.232
It's not about the stain or anything.

20:59.752 --> 21:04.782
I just taught you yesterday that the basics are important.

21:07.072 --> 21:09.662
But still...

21:15.432 --> 21:20.712
I guess you weren't listening to anything I
said about the importance of the basics.

21:20.752 --> 21:25.432
I shall teach you and make SURE you learn.

21:30.722 --> 21:31.702
Shiratori!

21:31.702 --> 21:34.142
We'll never work on homework at your place ever again!

21:34.182 --> 21:35.062
Ouch!

21:38.812 --> 21:40.072
Good luck.

22:00.343 --> 22:06.853
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:06.933 --> 22:12.653
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:14.073 --> 22:20.533
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:20.783 --> 22:25.833
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:27.793 --> 22:34.543
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:34.793 --> 22:40.473
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:41.473 --> 22:47.313
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:47.313 --> 22:49.563
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:49.773 --> 22:55.943
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:56.443 --> 23:02.283
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

23:02.283 --> 23:06.913
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

23:22.943 --> 23:23.983
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:23.983 --> 23:25.883
You're acting strange.
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:25.883 --> 23:27.723
Did you eat something bad?
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:27.723 --> 23:31.513
Say, why are there only men and women in this world?
The Next Episode Preview Corner

